Also `buildStreetLayer` returns {canvas:c,signs}; LAYER_B.layer build uses g.translate(PAD,PAD) - static coordinates base. Good.

Layer C has transparent background except haze/skyline; drawn under transform. Good.

Now scene C:

```
function drawRooftop(t){
 u=t-17.52; p...
 // sky gradient
 const night progress, moon reveal
 sky fill full
 // stars under transform
 s=1.02+0.05*p; ox=960*(1-s)+30*p; oy=560*(1-s)-? + tilt
 tilt = 170*ease((u-7.0)/1.76)
